        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll-and-Move race boardgame where you become a intrepid hero on a quest to free the kingdom from an evil enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will control your adventurer's moves and actions thrugh a gloomy abandoned castle, up to the last room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and traps will try to stop you from reaching your goal and other valiant paladins will race you to the glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, roll the dice. Your quest awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance in the castle, reach the last tile and be the first player to defeat the final boss!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically use 4, 6 and 8 sided dice to survive turn after turn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face skeletons, ghosts and the legendary Black Knight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get magical treasures like the Sacred Sword or the Lucky Amulet!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use shortcuts to advance faster through the castle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and above all, don't trust mirrors!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically enanched Goose Game rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode vs AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer up to 3 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holiday special gimmicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic dice rolls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple languages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minutes avarage playtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
